	(text "C101: supply bypass. C102: series output coupling. Neither value is published in the checked sources.\nY101 uses functional VDD / GND / OUT identifiers, not assumed package pin numbers.\nThe fourth oscillator pad, maker, output waveform and amplitude remain unidentified."
		(at 20.32 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
